{"3202290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chess Arena", "steam_appid": 3202290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h1>Join the Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202290/extras/cd3d8e1e58a908582e97433cd0de5871.avif?t=1770659378\" width=1240 height=220 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40-player real-time chess battle royale on a massive chessboard. Outplay enemies with chess tactics and game-changing ability kits. Master the chaos as the storm closes in to be the last King standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time chess tactics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The same pieces as classic chess, but they move in real-time. Master tactical positioning and timing. Fork, check, and pin, but also dodge, bait, and weave. Attack and defend, but with multiple pieces at once</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202290/extras/c3b4e43b6fc96fd595da9dfe74434460.poster.avif?t=1770659378\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202290/extras/c3b4e43b6fc96fd595da9dfe74434460.webm?t=1770659378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202290/extras/c3b4e43b6fc96fd595da9dfe74434460.mp4?t=1770659378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Champion ability kits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a chess champion with game-changing abilities, wreaking destruction, chaos, deception, or control on the battlefield. Ability depth multiplies with chess tactics to create an unreachable skill ceiling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202290/extras/51b2a25e3e3a18653da4488e4e878350.poster.avif?t=1770659378\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202290/extras/51b2a25e3e3a18653da4488e4e878350.webm?t=1770659378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202290/extras/51b2a25e3e3a18653da4488e4e878350.mp4?t=1770659378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle royale chaos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace chess with a competitive battle royale twist. 40 Kings start on a massive map. Grow stronger by defeating other players and PvE challenges. Fights erupt unpredictably, ranging from 1v1 duels to 5-man brawls. The storm gradually tightens the space, forcing epic conflicts that leave only 1 player as the last King standing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202290/extras/1e75684e419266e90733b0f521e9c7c3.poster.avif?t=1770659378\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202290/extras/1e75684e419266e90733b0f521e9c7c3.webm?t=1770659378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202290/extras/1e75684e419266e90733b0f521e9c7c3.mp4?t=1770659378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40-player battle royale in a massive, multi-biome arena</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 champions with 3 abilities each (passive, basic, ultimate)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich social features (proximity chat, text chat, emoting)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >User profile with rich game stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards of all shapes and sizes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprise, limited-time game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant Discord scene with rich event calendar (tournaments, scrims)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole new fantasy chess universe waiting to be revealed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202290/extras/90df22643bf096b0d8794276e55c6e95.avif?t=1770659378\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202290/extras_big/90df22643bf096b0d8794276e55c6e95.avif?t=1770659378 width=1560 height=798 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40-player real-time chess battle royale on a massive chessboard. Outplay enemies with chess tactics and game-changing ability kits. Master the chaos as the storm closes in to be the last King standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time chess tactics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The same pieces as classic chess, but they move in real-time. Master tactical positioning and timing. Fork, check, and pin, but also dodge, bait, and weave. Attack and defend, but with multiple pieces at once</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202290/extras/c3b4e43b6fc96fd595da9dfe74434460.poster.avif?t=1770659378\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_